Based on content from the Western Australian Legislation website at 28 October 2026 to 29 October 2026. For the latest information on Western Australian legislation, visit www.legislation.wa.gov.au.

Changes made: the text is split into one file per provision, with note-reference numbers, the cover page and the
table of contents removed, and arranged as a git history.

